{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46604","headline":"谢王先辈昆弟游湘中回各见示新诗 · 齐己","name":"谢王先辈昆弟游湘中回各见示新诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"潇湘多胜异，宗社久裴回。\n兄弟同游去，幽奇尽采来。\n只应求妙唱，何以示寒灰。\n上国携归後，唯呈不世才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}